  <acqinfo id="6b2d03eaefa19565ad8935e099a76c84">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>This material was transferred to RAC in 2021 by the Ford Foundation and ingested by RAC as Accession 2021:014.</p>  </acqinfo>
  <scopecontent id="6af8ee5457e68916414fc03ba9346876">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The collection includes reports, proposals, and planning materials from the Ford Foundation's Democracy, Rights, and Justice (DRJ) program. The collection highlights Alta Starr's assessment of many organizations and causes, including Beloved Community Center, Building Partnerships, the Center for Policy Alternatives, the Gulf Coast Transformation Initiative (GCTI). Grassroots Global Justice Alliance, the Highlander Center, and immigration initiatives.</p>  </scopecontent>
